    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.15
  m_Text: '2. Legal Basis for Data Processing

    We process limited anonymous user
    data in compliance with global data protection regulations and legal requirements,
    based on the following legitimate grounds:

    Service Operation Guarantee:
    To maintain the normal operation of coin merge game functions, optimize basic
    gameplay, and resolve user experience problems.

    Legitimate Operational Interests:
    To analyze game operation data, adjust merge gameplay balance, optimize product
    performance, and upgrade user interactive experience.

    Security Protection:
    To detect abnormal operations, cheating behaviors, unauthorized access risks,
    and ensure the overall security of game services.

    User Consent: For data
    processing behaviors regulated by relevant laws, operations will be carried out
    based on your voluntary authorization, and you have the right to withdraw consent
    at any time.'
