    m_LineSpacing: 1.15
  m_Text: '6. Data Storage and Retention Cycle

    User local game progress and
    preference data are permanently stored on the user''s personal device and will
    not be uploaded to our cloud server. The anonymous technical data and operation
    logs collected by the server will only be retained within the time required for
    service optimization and technical maintenance. After the data loses operational
    value, we will actively delete or anonymize all relevant data. Aggregated non-identifiable
    statistical data can be retained for long-term product iteration analysis.'
