    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 0
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1.15
  m_Text: '3. Information Collection Scope

    Merge Stack Journey adheres to the
    principle of minimal data collection and does not collect any sensitive personal
    privacy information. The collected information is limited to the following categories:

    Information
    Voluntarily Provided by Users. This game does not require user registration,
    login, or real-name authentication. We only collect feedback content voluntarily
    submitted by users when contacting customer support.

    Automatically Collected
    Anonymous Information. Basic anonymous device technical information, including
    device model, system version, and device language settings.

    Anonymous game
    behavior data, including game session duration, coin merging interaction records,
    and local game progress.

    Anonymous crash logs and operation exception data
    for technical troubleshooting and compatibility optimization.

    Information
    from Third-Party Channels. If you authorize third-party platform services related
    to the game, we may obtain limited anonymous data in accordance with third-party
    privacy policies and your personal account settings, and no sensitive personal
    information will be obtained.'
