  m_Text: '4. Data Sharing and Disclosure Rules

    We will not sell, trade, or
    leak user personal data for commercial purposes. We may only share anonymous,
    non-identifiable data with the following qualified parties to support normal
    service operation:

    Technical service providers responsible for game hosting,
    data statistics, compatibility testing, and technical maintenance.

    Authorized
    third-party SDK providers integrated in the game for basic service support.

    Legal
    regulatory authorities, when required by legal provisions and official lawful
    requests.

    All third-party parties involved in data processing have independent
    privacy compliance obligations and shall bear corresponding data protection responsibilities.'
