  m_Text: '3. Prohibited Activities

    When using Merge Stack Journey, you are
    strictly prohibited from engaging in the following behaviors. Any violation will
    result in corresponding service restrictions:

    Utilize cheating tools, automated
    scripts, plug-ins, game loopholes, or technical exploits to manipulate coin merging
    gameplay, gain improper in-game advantages, or disrupt normal game operation.

    Conduct
    reverse engineering, decompilation, code modification, resource extraction, tampering,
    or secondary development of the game software and related program files.

    Use
    the Services for illegal, violent, discriminatory, obscene, infringing, or any
    activities that violate public order and good customs.

    Spread malicious
    programs, harmful files, or unauthorized third-party content through the game
    platform.

    Copy, distribute, repackage, or commercially exploit game UI,
    coin theme art assets, merge gameplay logic, and all exclusive game resources.'
